opam-version: "2.0"
synopsis: "MSVC from the environment (toolchain spike)"
description: """
opam's conf-msvc64 searches for a Visual Studio installation with
msvs-detect, which finds none on GitHub's Windows runners. The pixi
environment already provides MSVC through its activation, so this one
takes it as it is."""
